# Generated WCAG contrast audit report. Never committed — it's a rendering of
# guaranteed-green state (the contrast guard tests enforce the facts). Produced
# fresh as a CI artifact and emitted into dist/ by the Vite build (served at
# /CONTRAST-AUDIT.md), so it's always current by construction.
